// Game: Generic
// Format: Standard
// area-lights-ab-grid: manual check M3 of the area-lights brief, the template
// half of an A/B pair with area-lights-ab-panel.map (same geometry and
// entities). The glass is plain worldspawn glowing by its texture strength,
// and each panel is a grid of light delay 2 point lights, one per square
// metre of glass, 12 units below it (the ericw-tools `_surface` template
// offset is 2, but a 0.25 m soft emitter that close sinks 40% into the glass):
// 16 at light 300 under the skylight, one at light 100 under the
// corridor panel. Each template point reaches 630 units, a 1 m^2 panel's
// reach at light 300; the corridor point reaches 370, the panel's.
// See: content/dev/maps/area-lights-ab.README.md
